# The autosave timer writes the copy by itself, once the interval has passed since the document became dirty and the keyboard has been quiet for the idle wait; typing holds it off, and the next change starts the interval again.
@recovery
@file "C:\\DOCS\\LETTER.QLD" "dear sir"
cmd Open
choose "C:\\DOCS\\LETTER.QLD"
type ", and madam"
@quiet 6s
@clock +592s
dump
@quiet 2s
dump
type " yours"
@clock +700s
dump
@quiet 2s
dump
cmd Save
dump
